{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:5fd655bb929817d4","name":"Wrist Rocket Launcher","source":{"id":"source:reference-5fd655bb929817d4","title":"Wrist Rocket Launcher","revision":20097,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:11:58Z","sha256":"a0be641c24260b202f2b39f3c8a9bbf4a7742e8842eaf484dec40d7108002de0","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20097","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Wrist%20Rocket%20Launcher&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-5fd655bb929817d4","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Wrist Rocket Launcher is a versatile personal weapon designed to be useful in various combat situations. It mounts on the forearm and extends over the back of the wielder's hand. Bounty hunters favor the weapon, despite various government attempts to ban the weapons and force production to stop. Wrist Rocket Launchers are Single-Shot Weapons that must be reloaded after each shot. They fire only Wrist Rockets, and are considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"}," for the purposes of determining ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The open market offers a wide variety of rockets for use with the Wrist Rocket Launcher. The most common of these rockets can be found below:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Antipersonnel Rocket"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["This style of Rocket functions like a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Frag Grenade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Frag_Grenade","referenceId":"reference:5d38df4b2da8b77e"},", but it does not affect multiple squares.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 400\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"