e target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},". If the secondary attack succeeds, the Nerve Agent is injected into the target's body and moves the target -2 steps on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 600\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.25 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Piercing\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Illegal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illegal"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Hollow-Tip (Stun Gas)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["A Hollow-Tip Rocket is used as a means of exposing the target to a drug or chemical stored inside it's specialized tip. A Stun Gas Hollow-Tip Rocket spays out gas upon impact, created a cloud that fills the square.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 400\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d6 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"},")\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," Radius:"]}," 1-Square\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.25 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Piercing\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Ion Blast Rocket"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["An Ion Blast Rocket emits an ionizing wave of energy in all directions upon impact that affects electronic devices, including ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/D